lm(A + B);" }{TEXT -1 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "> " 0 "" {MPLTEXT 1 0 14 "evalm(
A &* B);" }{TEXT -1 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "> " 0 "" {MPLTEXT 1 0 13 "evalm(k \+
