{TEXT -1 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT -1 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT 
-1 56 "Enfin, on peut faire plusieurs calculs sur les matrices." }}
{PARA 0 "" 0 "" {TEXT -1 0 "" }{MPLTEXT 1 0 0 "" }}{PARA 0 "> " 0 "" 
